    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you reach a Ranger level specified in the Fey Wanderer Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><p>You also possess a fey blessing. Choose it from the Feywild Gifts table or determine it randomly.</p><h4>Feywild Gifts</h4><table><thead><tr><th>1d6</th><th>Gift</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Illusory butterflies flutter around you while you take a Short or Long Rest.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Flowers bloom from your hair each dawn.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>You faintly smell of cinnamon, lavender, nutmeg, or another comforting herb or spice.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Your shadow dances while no one is looking directly at it.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Horns or antlers sprout from your head.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Your skin and hair change color each dawn.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
